      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>In (your) na(me, O Merciful)</li>\n<li>Your slave Joseph</li>\n<li>kisses the ground before (<i>your) ex(ellency), hono(r), gr(eatness), ho(liness), pre(cious),</i></li>\n<li><i>el(evated), pe(arl), wr(eath), cr(own), gl(ory), (our) ma(ster) and te(acher),</i></li>\n<li><i>Yeshu\u02bfa the great Dignitary among the Jews, may God his Rock protect him</i></li>\n<li><i>and be his succor,</i> and informs you</li>\n<li>that your slave is being killed by the cold</li>\n<li>and by hunger. Your slave cannot face asking</li>\n<li>anything from anyone. Your slave's request</li>\n<li>from our merciful and charitable master is for</li>\n<li>help with money for a robe. You will earn a</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
      "motivation": [
