          "value": "<p></p>\n\n<ol><li>reward that [is written], \"<i>When you se[e the naked],</i></li>\n<li><i>clothe him [and]</i></li>\n<li><i>do not ignore [your own kin]</i>\" (Isaiah 58:7).</li>\n<li>Your slave in[f]orms you</li>\n<li>about this. <i>And peace.</i></li></ol>\n",
